WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.701
-Well, guys, today is Friday

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.734
and that's usually when I

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:03.534
catch up with some
personal stuff.

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:05.033
I check my inbox, return emails,

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:06.501
and I write out
some thank you notes

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:07.934
and I was wondering
if I could write some tonight.

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:09.901
[ Cheering and applause ]
Is that okay?

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:12.100
James, can I get some thank you
note-writing music please?

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.434
[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:15.968
[ Laughter ]
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:17.801
-Jeez!
-He's in a good mood.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:18.901
-Wow.

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:20.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:23.667
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:25.367
Thank you, "Plane,"

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.934
for being in the one flight this
week that didn't get canceled.

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:31.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:31.834
Appreciate it.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.534
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:39.267
Thank you,
Dr Pepper-flavored Peeps,

00:00:39.267 --> 00:00:41.634
for, somehow, not being called
Dr Peepers.

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:42.868
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Why not?

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.000
-It's right there.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:44.767
-Why wouldn't you do it?
-Why would you not?

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.334
-What?

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.601
At least Dr. Pibb.
-Call me. These people have
to call me.

00:00:49.734 --> 00:00:51.167
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:54.100
Thank you, people with Christmas
decorations still up...

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.334
[ Laughter ]
for introducing your neighbors

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.868
to the fun new game
Lazy, Out of Town, or Dead?

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:02.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:03.901
Not necessarily healthy.

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:05.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:06.934
♪♪
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:09.601
Thank you, gas stoves,
for looking like

00:01:09.601 --> 00:01:12.000
I'm staring down
at a Troll doll drum circle.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:20.934
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.033
Thank you,
Fruit by the Foot,

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:24.968
for being the red carpet
of fruit leather.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:27.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:33.901
Thank you, Scratch-Off
lottery tickets,

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.834
for pretty much being the only
reason people still use coins.

00:01:36.834 --> 00:01:39.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:40.033
Hey, that's interesting.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:40.834
-[ Indistinct ]

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.234
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:49.667
Thank you, today,
for being Friday the 13th,

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.667
which means only one thing...

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:54.767
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.300
It's Patrick Dempsey's birthday!

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.934
[ Hip hop oompah music plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.801
[ Clapping rhythmically ]

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:13.834
There you have it!

00:02:13.834 --> 00:02:15.100
Those were my Thank You Notes.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.434
When we come back,
we're playing Charades

00:02:16.434 --> 00:02:18.234
with Lea Michele, Sadie Sink.

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:19.801
Stick around, everybody!

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:26.801
♪♪

